B.SN=new A.S(B.t,["Salient Features & Preamble","Lengthiest written constitution, drawn from various sources. Preamble is the identity card (N.A. Palkhivala). Sovereign, Socialist, Secular, Democratic, Republic. Berubari Union and Kesavananda Bharati cases.",""],t.w)
B.SD=new A.S(B.t,["Union and its Territory","Articles 1 to 4 under Part I. Article 3 allows Parliament to form new states. Dhar Commission, JVP Committee, Fazl Ali Commission for reorganization of states.",""],t.w)
