B.S9=new A.S(B.t,["Formation of INC (1885)","Founded by A.O. Hume. Moderate phase (1885-1905) led by Dadabhai Naoroji, G.K. Gokhale. Demand for constitutional reforms and economic critique (Drain Theory).",""],t.w)
B.SH=new A.S(B.t,["Extremist Phase & Swadeshi (1905-1917)","Partition of Bengal (Curzon, 1905). Lal-Bal-Pal. Swadeshi and Boycott movement. Surat Split (1907). Morley-Minto Reforms (1909) and separate electorates.",""],t.w)
